    "title": "Knicks' N'Faly Dante: Signs Exhibit 10 deal - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By RotoWire Staff ,\n8 hours ago Dante (knee) signed an Exhibit 10 contract with the Knicks on Saturday. Dante underwent surgery in January to repair a torn ACL and is expected to miss time to begin the 2026-27 season, so it's possible this is a move to secure his G League rights. Over four appearances with the G League's College Park Skyhawks last season, he averaged 11.8 points, 5.8 rebounds, 2.2 assists, 0.8 steals and 0.8 blocks across 16.2 minutes per contest. Read full article",
